### Menu pre hosťa
GET http://localhost:8080/api/menu

### Slanina nedostupná
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/ingredients/9
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "slanina", "available": false}

### Slanina opäť dostupná
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/admin/ingredients/9
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "slanina", "available": true}

### Nová položka
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId": 2, "name": "Vyprážaný syr", "description": "hranolky, tatárska omáčka", "price": 9.50, "available": true, "ingredients": [{"ingredientId": 5, "type": "BASE", "removable": false, "extraPrice": null}]}

### Chyba: záporná cena
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/menu-items
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId": 2, "name": "Test", "description": "", "price": -1, "available": true, "ingredients": []}